  "expenditureInfoScienceTitle": "Scientific basis",
  "expenditureInfoScienceBody": "Base metabolism: Mifflin-St Jeor (1990) or Cunningham (1980, lean-mass based) equations. Thermic effect of food: Westerterp (2004). Non-exercise movement (NEAT): Levine (2002). Energy balance principle: Hall et al. (2011), the model behind the NIH Body Weight Planner. Adaptive calibration methodology inspired by principles published in the nutrition-tracking literature — never a reproduction of a third-party proprietary algorithm.",
